{"title":"1994 USAMO Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_USAMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/b/34be6f394fa242f827a505451dab50e697b15426.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\, a_1, a_2, a_3, \\ldots \\,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"98\" height=\"11\" /> be a sequence of positive real numbers satisfying <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/f/72fbe95e2ac2315907ad3490e697337e98f1a1da.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\, \\sum_{j = 1}^n a_j \\geq \\sqrt {n} \\,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"98\" height=\"50\" /> for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/0/c702292eab37345aba85b9b996947909d6166622.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\, n \\geq 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />. Prove that, for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/2/8a2a4f875b28d143640f21092c426c803d91f168.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\, n \\geq 1, \\,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"51\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/9/8293056937b2c93fb3ccfde0a9b743d24fd9660d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sum_{j = 1}^n a_j^2 &gt; \\frac {1}{4} \\left( 1 + \\frac {1}{2} + \\cdots + \\frac {1}{n} \\right).\\]\" width=\"243\" height=\"49\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_USAMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Note that if we try to minimize <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3337ec4bb62641480f304d1d08d9192537c9634.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a_j)^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"36\" height=\"19\" />, we would try to make the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/8/0785f19824c8b23ab3dfe000b471994078fdf589.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_j$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"15\" height=\"12\" /> as equal as possible. However, by the condition given in the problem, this isn't possible, the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/8/0785f19824c8b23ab3dfe000b471994078fdf589.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_j$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"15\" height=\"12\" />'s have to be an increasing sequence. Thinking of minimizing sequences, we realize that the optimal equation is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/f/e8f112cd2d2d9499a95cc09694657e8391d6a38a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_n = \\sqrt{n} - \\sqrt{n-1} = 1/(\\sqrt{n} + \\sqrt{n-1})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"309\" height=\"20\" />. Note that this is strictly greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/c/33c4ac2ddbf78a8876ccbc4001a7cc0906723d22.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1/(2\\sqrt{n})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"66\" height=\"19\" />. So it is greater than the sum of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/5/db5949b55dbafd2cf224406f6e7045fe9cdcc4bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1/\\sqrt{4n})^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"73\" height=\"21\" /> over all n from 1 to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/7/b671f1bb7e4ee86584347d5d22f1dc8abdb5bef2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\infty$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"17\" height=\"9\" />. So the sum we are looking to minimize is strictly greater than the sum of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/a/c5afaedec838e1de2860d62ab276839f130f7587.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1/4n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"37\" height=\"18\" /> over all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> from 1 to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/7/b671f1bb7e4ee86584347d5d22f1dc8abdb5bef2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\infty$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"17\" height=\"9\" />, which is what we wanted to do.\n</p><p>——\nDear the critical link here is missing: to prove that the optimal equation is a(n)=√n-√(n-1). It is therefore incomplete.\n~T\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_USAMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Consider a sequence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/2/00218966ac82e4a270100737d65582e4472346a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b_n = \\sqrt{n} - \\sqrt{n-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"149\" height=\"22\" />. \n</p><p><b>Lemma: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/f/8ffd01cdc48042ce7c67d8edcd4904809831cfe4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"16\" height=\"15\" /> minimizes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/3/bc36a76a08761231c97f96ec963825e05ddfb4fc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{k=1}^n a_k^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"48\" height=\"53\" /> over the term <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/3/3e3dc18fb2d6d0a2645b5e183cf413cafb937bbd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_k=a_1+\\cdots+a_k\\ge \\sqrt{k}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"195\" height=\"23\" /></b>.\n</p><p><b>Proof of the Lemma:</b>\n</p><p>Note <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/a/c7af1c50e05219c8d6ec1cc13bbcb4f34aa4e7d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b_k=\\sqrt{k}-\\sqrt{k-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"146\" height=\"23\" />. We show that if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/2/e42f6929d7e549292eff07892384cf7f86f2500f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_k\\ge\\sqrt{k}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"71\" height=\"23\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/f/e1f88dde5f059bdc9786548443c9a86ca25361ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum a_k^2\\ge\\sum b_k^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"117\" height=\"31\" />. Define <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/d/c9dc381f245fc61e16c341bec8fef342311067b0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c_k=S_k-\\sqrt{k}\\ge0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"142\" height=\"23\" /> the extra amount over equality. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/5/b9538a76646f2b4a7e470d1b5cd4747c11a2dbf3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_k-b_k=(S_k-S_{k-1})-(\\sqrt{k}-\\sqrt{k-1}) =c_k-c_{k-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"410\" height=\"24\" />. Hence in other words, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/a/bea4d576937a04ec200b1037fc8ee33e8f744cb1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"16\" height=\"10\" /> is just the equality sequence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/b/b6bdec4394870e8a713538ce428bea9d41c8775f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b_k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> plus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/d/3bd87559f4e4c9af40246a0fdbafe6feab507414.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c_k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"15\" height=\"10\" />. Now, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/e/ffe4e71334e8882e83671d0cc4595eb5147940ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum a_k^2=\\sum(b_k+c_k-c_{k-1})^2 = \\sum b_k^2 + \\sum(c_k-c_{k-1})^2+2\\sum b_k(c_k-c_{k-1})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"603\" height=\"31\" />. Now we must show that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/3/4833214ddba728f53bf0bbd7ffeb8885aa0c9965.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum(c_k-c_{k-1})^2+2\\sum b_k(c_k-c_{k-1}) \\geq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"318\" height=\"31\" />. The first term is trivial. The second one, rewrite as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/0/d707068dc5f2503e08a5305dbdb625ce50990981.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b_nc_n+\\sum_{k=1}^{n-1}(b_k-b_{k+1})c_k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"185\" height=\"56\" /> in which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/2/702068e6749f47d2995b07e653edf36329c78544.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c_k \\geq 0, b_n \\geq 0,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"115\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/e/afe10238e4612186374426bf7e2e2627caec143e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b_k \\geq b_{k+1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"75\" height=\"18\" />, as it is concave. Hence, each term, when summed, yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/0/e100ee688f8f0162a35c7f18712c28592f7c5916.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\geq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"27\" height=\"15\" />. Hence we are done. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/b/3bbb9e25e5be095e317771a9c5d00877ee9c8012.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\blacksquare$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><b>USAMO 1994/4:</b>\n</p><p>Consider <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/8/0785f19824c8b23ab3dfe000b471994078fdf589.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_j$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"15\" height=\"12\" />. Notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/f/0df7008112c763c446382bb034760886ff6456e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt j-\\sqrt{j-1}=\\frac{j-(j-1)}{\\sqrt j+\\sqrt{j-1}}=\\frac1{\\sqrt j+\\sqrt{j-1}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"366\" height=\"45\" />. Squaring, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/e/dae2c30b788d1178ec949bc428f20799fe33e60a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\sqrt j-\\sqrt{j-1})^2=\\frac1{(\\sqrt j+\\sqrt{j-1})^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"280\" height=\"43\" />. Also, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/7/f77d87548e8adf359f96a367eef01e1dbb163cdc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt j+\\sqrt{j-1}&lt;2\\sqrt j$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"168\" height=\"24\" /> is trivial by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/8/fb84b510c3124915df204b298256834a6d3d040b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{j-1}&lt;\\sqrt j$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"110\" height=\"24\" /> hence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/f/3bf74ac3247370823d7ce1b67b0e4992c6ac0a46.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\sqrt j+\\sqrt{j-1})^2&lt;4j$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"171\" height=\"24\" />. Also, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/e/dae2c30b788d1178ec949bc428f20799fe33e60a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\sqrt j-\\sqrt{j-1})^2=\\frac1{(\\sqrt j+\\sqrt{j-1})^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"280\" height=\"43\" /> and thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/c/ccc2125028e7cec53b180956df16381ecbe93a4f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac1{(\\sqrt j+\\sqrt{j-1})^2}&gt;\\frac1{4j}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"174\" height=\"43\" />. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/1/3c172e9e3628be20eb5668969751cb47530fe157.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\sqrt j-\\sqrt{j-1})^2&gt;\\frac1{4j}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"175\" height=\"42\" />. Taking the sum 1 through <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> gives the desired result. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/c/b6cf65b1f2fbdf388e3daeff9b96b34d3399d777.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\square$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>~Pinotation\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_USAMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:40%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_USAMO\" title=\"1994 USAMO\">1994 USAMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_USAMO_Problems\" title=\"1994 USAMO Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=27&amp;year=1994\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_USAMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1994 USAMO Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_USAMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1994 USAMO Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_USAMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1994 USAMO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_USAMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1994 USAMO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_USAMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1994 USAMO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_USAMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1994 USAMO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=USAMO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"USAMO Problems and Solutions\"> All USAMO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017184747\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.046 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.064 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 270/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1267/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 44/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 8773/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   13.721      1 -total\n 57.18%    7.845      1 Template:USAMO_box\n 39.66%    5.442      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:9241:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017184747 and revision id 288611. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}